# Ignore backup files ending with .--BAK
**/*.--BAK

# Ignore all files in folders named 00__Archive (any depth)
**/00__Archive/**
**/00__Archive/*
**/01__ArchivedVersions/**
**/01__ArchivedVersions/*

# Ignore the project backup version of SketchUp to GLB , so Cursor always find the C Drive Location
**90__rubyScript__SketchUpSisterTools__ToolsAndUtils/**

# Ignore markdown files marked as hidden (ending with .mdh)
*.mdh